Scope and limits
----------------
This release is a deterministic sensitivity analysis of Bodytype's v2
four-girth classification rules on a synthetic rule-space grid. It is not a
population sample, an accuracy study, a measurement-error model, medical data
or a medical device. It contains no user measurements.

The full grid contains 669,858 synthetic rows. The site page reports aggregate
results; the full parquet file is distributed through the dataset release, not
the site repository.

Files and checksums
-------------------
